You can't retrieve by column name, but you can associate a column name with an index.  Just do something like this to figure out the appropriate column indexes

for(i in 1:length(readval[[2]][[2]])) {
 print(readval[[2]][[2]][i])
 print(i)
}

[1] "base:Desc"
[1] 1
[1] "base:Name"
[1] 2
[1] "base:Value"
[1] 3

